@ProductsApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7073

### 1. Obtener todos los productos (Espera 200)
GET {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products

### 2. Buscar por nombre (Etapa 7.1)
GET {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/search?name=teclado

### 3. Estadísticas (Etapa 7.2)
GET {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/stats

### 4. (Espera 200)
GET {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/3

### 5. (Espera 404)
GET {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/999

### 6. (Espera 201)
POST {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pad Gamer XL",
  "price": 12500.00
}

### 7. (Espera 400 Bad Request)
POST {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 100
}

### 8. (Espera 409 Conflict)
POST {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teclado mecánico",
  "price": 8500.00
}

### 9. (Espera 204)
PUT {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse inalámbrico Pro",
  "price": 4500.00
}

### 10. (Espera 204)
DELETE {{ProductsApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/2